// Name :
"P3365661715" "Back Alley Brawler"
// ProfessionString :
"P1188477434" "Independent"
// DescriptionString :
"P3365260518" "The Brawler was the son of a gang enforcer. He joined the Paragon City police force to try and make a difference. When he realized that was not getting the job done he adopted the name and costume of a hero. He fought in the streets and alleys, of the city, all through the late 70's and the 80's. He briefly went into retirement after that, but came back out to help with the Rikti war.<br><br>One of the most veteran heroes in Paragon City, the Brawler is in semi-retirement, training the next generation of heroes. Though he rarely goes into the field these days, his power and fighting skills are still as potent as ever."
// HelloString :
"P3078984749" "What's up, youngster?"
// HelloString :
"P2778151463" "You look like you need some help."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3154829561" "You are barking up the wrong tree, youngster."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2364816028" "Little Ms. Liberty says you got the stuff, {HeroName}. You wouldn't want to prove her worng, now would you?"
// SubContactsDisplay :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3263880721" "Looks like Ms. Liberty, was right about you after all."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1042180384" "Move on, youngster."
// IntroString :
"P3025612172" "The Back Alley Brawler is one of the cities oldest surviving heroes. He won't steer you wrong."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1602907074" "Choose Back Alley Brawler"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2674380308" "The Brawler is a no nonsense kind of guy."
// LocationString :
"P2848267662" "Galaxy City"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P556112955" "Go find Positron, Youngster."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3343443605" "IntroduceTwoContacts"
// StoreTitleString :
"P268763520" "StoreTitleString"
// StoreYouBoughtXXXString :
"P1147715973" "StoreYouBoughtXXXString"
