"P1315090902" "One of the deadliest covert agents in the world, Belladonna has proven herself a most capable spy and killer for the Resistance. Though her past is a well kept secret, Belladonna makes it clear that she has no love for Tyrant or his lackeys. Rumors abound that she was trained by Chimera; Tyrant's Praetor of Intelligence and widely considered the deadliest assassin in the world. Belladonna will one day put that title to the test."
// HelloString :
// SubContactsDisplay :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3855166101" "You itching to pick up a few techniques?"
