"P3937920482" "Born with the ability to create and manipulate Flame, Christopher Thales never had much interest in being a Super Hero. Instead, he focused on his career in politics and public service. That changed when the Rikti invaded though, and since that day, he has been a stalwart defender of Paragon City as Castle!"
