"P775205338" "Megan Duncan is the daughter of the original Miss Liberty from the Golden Age. She has taken up the mantle to fight for freedom, in this specific case to free Paragon City from its infestation of villains. She has heightened strength and endurance as well as the power of the Liberty Belt, which was passed on to her by her grandmother."
// HelloString :
"P4260001931" "Hey there, {HeroName}!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P973700779" "IDontKnowYou"
// FirstVisitString :
"P459743353" "We need new heroes to help protect Paragon City, {HeroName}. I hope you are willing and able to help free this place from the chains of villainy!"
// SubContactsDisplay :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2749441579" "You are doing great so far, {HeroName}. Keep it up!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P898814823" "I will give you my highest marks, when I speak to the other heroes about you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P99338031" "The time has come for you to talk to some of the surviving heroes from the Rikti war."
// IntroString :
"P1647070507" "You should speak to Ms. Liberty, in Atlas Park. She can usually be found in Atlas Plaza, and helps newer heroes with matters of Security level. "
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3087447489" "Choose Ms. Liberty"
// IntroSendoffString :
