// Name :
"P3572173380" "Odysseus"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P2048666713" "Odysseus was once a powerful magic wielding super hero who fought alongside Marcus Cole during the Hamidon Wars. But in the aftermath the world changed, and Cole became the omnipotent Emperor of the Earth. Odysseus was killed during the upheaval, as world governments and their own loyal supers clung pointlessly to their dwindling power. But now a man claiming to be the very same has appeared in the ranks of the Resistance. Despite his disheveled appearance and apparent lack of any of Odysseus's magical artifacts, Calvin Scott has stood by the man's claims. Two things are certain; the man knows how to fight, and he doesn't take crap from anybody."
// HelloString :
// SubContactsDisplay :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P244495690" "You came here to do some business, so let's get down to it!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3030611061" "I like your style, you know that, kiddo?"
// LocationString :
"P1596840781" "Underground Imperial"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


